sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client / Frontend
    participant Route as Route<br/>Backend.API/Routes
    participant Ctrl as Controller<br/>Backend.API/Controllers
    participant Svc as Service<br/>Backend.BLL/Services
    participant Repo as Repository<br/>Backend.DAL/Repositories
    participant Db as AppDbContext / DB
    participant Model as Model<br/>Backend.Models

    Client->>Route: HTTP request<br/>GET /example/hello_world?name=Alice
    Note over Route: Bind DTO<br/>e.g. [AsParameters] on GET
    Route->>Ctrl: Call controller method with DTO
    Ctrl->>Svc: Call IExampleService method
    alt Persistence needed
        Svc->>Repo: Read / write via repository
        Repo->>Db: EF Core query
        Db-->>Repo: Rows
        Repo-->>Svc: Model(s)
    else No persistence
        Svc->>Model: Create / map model in memory
    end
    Svc-->>Ctrl: Model / result
    Ctrl-->>Route: Result
    Route-->>Client: HTTP response JSON
